濱鄉漁港疏浚及周邊環境工程。\n九、監督縣政，落實推展，理性強勢問政，反映民意，善盡為民代議之責。","unresolved":0}],"specificity":[{"claim":"10-014-03-1-001","criterion":"conditions","evidence":null,"id":"10-014-03-1-001-conditions","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有寫出適用條件、排除對象或替代方案","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-014-03-1-001","criterion":"funding","evidence":null,"id":"10-014-03-1-001-funding","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文只寫經費，沒有寫出來源、編列方式或金額","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-014-03-1-001","criterion":"implementation","evidence":null,"id":"10-014-03-1-001-implementation","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有說明由哪個單位、以什麼程序執行","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-014-03-1-001","criterion":"instrument","evidence":"爭取經費","id":"10-014-03-1-001-instrument","level":"partial","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文寫出「爭取經費」，符合部分明示：提出工具名稱或大方向","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.5},{"claim":"10-014-03-1-001","criterion":"quantity","evidence":null,"id":"10-014-03-1-001-quantity","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有可以核對的數字","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-014-03-1-001","criterion":"schedule","evidence":null,"id":"10-014-03-1-001-schedule","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有寫出時間安排","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-014-03-1-001","criterion":"target","evidence":"東海岸三鄉鎮","id":"10-014-03-1-001-target","level":"explicit","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文寫出「東海岸三鄉鎮」，符合完整明示：有可核對的資格、年齡或地域","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":1.0},{"claim":"10-014-03-1-002","criterion":"conditions","evidence":null,"id":"10-014-03-1-002-conditions","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有寫出適用條件、排除對象或替代方案","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-014-03-1-002","criterion":"funding","evidence":null,"id":"10-014-03-1-002-funding","level":"not-applicable","method":"模型判讀","reason":"管制規定不涉及政府經費","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":null},{"claim":"10-014-03-1-002","criterion":"implementation","evidence":nu